<div class="auth-card"><div class="auth-heading"><span class="eyebrow">Passwordless sign-in</span><h2>Sign in with an email code</h2><p>Applicants, students and authorised staff use the same secure six-digit email code.</p></div><form method="post" action="<?= url('login') ?>" class="auth-form"><?= csrf_field() ?><label><span>Email address</span><div class="input-with-icon"><i>@</i><input type="email" name="email" value="<?= e(old('email')) ?>" autocomplete="email" required autofocus placeholder="you@example.com"></div><?= error('email')?'<small class="field-error">'.e(error('email')).'</small>':'' ?></label><button class="button button-primary button-block" type="submit">Email me a sign-in code →</button></form><div class="auth-divider"><span>New applicant?</span></div><a class="button button-outline button-block" href="<?= url('register') ?>">Create an applicant account</a><div class="security-note"><span>⌾</span><p><b>Use an email address you control.</b> Codes expire after 10 minutes, can be used once, and are never retained in the email log.</p></div></div>
